    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wind Giants</i> is a narrative-driven 3D walking simulator that invites you on a mystical journey through a world reborn from catastrophe. Centuries ago, ancient sages, foreseeing a great disaster, devised a plan to restore the planet. They hid four enigmatic giants on floating islands, each tied to the primal elements of Earth, Air, Water, and Fire. Now, as the intrepid explorer, you must traverse these ethereal isles, uncover hidden clues, and solve intricate puzzles to awaken these slumbering guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your quest, you'll explore diverse landscapes\u2014from rugged terrains where you collect puzzle fragments to luminous pathways where beams of light reveal secret mechanisms. With each island presenting its own unique challenge and mystery, your journey becomes a tapestry of ancient legend and futuristic design, interwoven with vibrant visuals inspired by Andean mythology and Incan architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Experience first-person adventure across four distinct floating islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> Tackle elemental challenges\u2014from aligning mirrors to redirect light, to channeling water flows and igniting torches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storytelling:</strong> Unravel an ancient prophecy as you revive the planet through the awakening of the giants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where myth and mystery converge, and become the hero who brings a forgotten planet back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wind Giants</i> is a narrative-driven 3D walking simulator that invites you on a mystical journey through a world reborn from catastrophe. Centuries ago, ancient sages, foreseeing a great disaster, devised a plan to restore the planet. They hid four enigmatic giants on floating islands, each tied to the primal elements of Earth, Air, Water, and Fire. Now, as the intrepid explorer, you must traverse these ethereal isles, uncover hidden clues, and solve intricate puzzles to awaken these slumbering guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/77c0561cae0e0ac11a8e5b99f528356c.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your quest, you'll explore diverse landscapes\u2014from rugged terrains where you collect puzzle fragments to luminous pathways where beams of light reveal secret mechanisms. With each island presenting its own unique challenge and mystery, your journey becomes a tapestry of ancient legend and futuristic design, interwoven with vibrant visuals inspired by Andean mythology and Incan architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/daf35ba0e31ebc13a5fa7d32760852eb.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Experience first-person adventure across four distinct floating islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> Tackle elemental challenges\u2014from aligning mirrors to redirect light, to channeling water flows and igniting torches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storytelling:</strong> Unravel an ancient prophecy as you revive the planet through the awakening of the giants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where myth and mystery converge, and become the hero who brings a forgotten planet back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.poster.avif?t=1743041582\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.webm?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515980/extras/b0e2e21b8369c3e64fe27e03cfa2f738.mp4?t=1743041582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
